@page "/event-modifiers"
@rendermode @(new InteractiveServerRenderMode(prerender: false))

@*
    Prerendering is off for the same reason FoldParityPage gives, applied to a different symptom: with it
    on, the first HTML response carries the markup but no event listeners, and a wheel dispatched before
    the circuit connects would scroll regardless of what the modifier says. Empty until interactive means
    the spec cannot race it.
*@
<EventModifierView />
